{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0DQM", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0003": "$|\\mathcal{X}| = \\bigcup U_i$", "MATH_0004": "$U_i$", "MATH_0005": "$|\\mathcal{X}|$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-sober-qs}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:94a9354d1a41867f3ca86cf2a74b554816fa2be0b0a24ff6abb88b50005808e6", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8f8c9711e3556a20cfa10aadea1cc9837e3de78a4bccc1bc60665b116c403139", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an algebraic stack whose diagonal is quasi-compact\n(for example if <MATH_0002> is quasi-separated).\nThen there is an open covering <MATH_0003>\nwith <MATH_0004> spectral. In particular <MATH_0005> is\na sober topological space.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d71de0240fd16424939b3d9179643c10877339f81c7b73e7c8d064e32d04ca80", "unit_id": "tag:0DQQ:statement"}
